{
 "about": "How a TTML document becomes lyric lines. Owner decisions 2026-11-22: singer sides follow Android's rule (a singer change flips sides, the first singer starts on the left unless typed 'other', a group sings on the left, and a song that would sit 85 % or more on the right is mirrored); CJK pieces stay separate words (core/contracts/lyrics-words.json with explicit spacing: touching spans join otherwise). Background vocals, inline translations (x-translation) and romanizations (x-roman) are not part of the line's text, and its whitespace is collapsed to single spaces. A line without timed words is sung until its end. Gaps follow core/contracts/lyrics-gaps.json. nuvx-core::lyrics::ttml::parse_ttml (desktop) and Android's TtmlLyrics.parse (through nuvx-ffi) must agree. A word is [text, startMs, endMs, syllable count]; a background word is [text, startMs, endMs].",
 "cases": [
  {
   "name": "background vocals are kept apart from the line's text, and the gap starts where they end",
   "ttml": "<tt xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml\" xmlns:ttm=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata\"><body><div><p begin=\"1.0\" end=\"3.0\" ttm:agent=\"v1\"><span begin=\"1.0\" end=\"1.5\">Hel</span><span begin=\"1.5\" end=\"2.0\">lo</span> <span begin=\"2.0\" end=\"3.0\">you</span><span ttm:role=\"x-bg\"><span begin=\"2.5\" end=\"3.5\">(yeah)</span></span></p><p begin=\"9.0\" end=\"10.0\" ttm:agent=\"v2\">Line two</p></div></body></tt>",
   "lines": [
    {
     "start": 1000,
     "text": "Hello you",
     "align": "start",
     "words": [
      [
       "Hello",
       1000,
       2000,
       2
      ],
      [
       "you",
       2000,
       3000,
       0
      ]
     ],
     "background": [
      [
       "(yeah)",
       2500,
       3500
      ]
     ],
     "sungUntil": null
    },
    {
     "start": 3500,
     "text": "",
     "align": "start",
     "words": [],
     "background": [],
     "sungUntil": null
    },
    {
     "start": 9000,
     "text": "Line two",
     "align": "end",
     "words": [],
     "background": [],
     "sungUntil": 10000
    }
   ]
  },
  {
